Recommends: python3-flagtree-nvidia | python3-triton
Description: FlagAttention — memory-efficient attention operators (Triton)
 FlagAttention is a collection of memory-efficient attention operators
 implemented in the Triton language. It targets large-language-model
 training and inference workloads where the standard PyTorch attention
 path is memory-bound.
 .
 Triton (provided here by python3-flagtree-nvidia or upstream
 python3-triton) is required at runtime; without it the kernels
 cannot JIT-compile.
